        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin WES-TRR, Baldwin Westcliff Entrance Set with Traditional Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Westcliff Handleset features an arched exterior plate and round roses on the inside. It is available in an array finishes--all of which have a 25 year warranty. Made by Baldwin, it is built to last; the Westcliff Entryset has a lifetime mechanical warranty. It is available as a single cylinder, a double cylinder, or a full dummy. The adjustable latch will accommodate 2-3/4 inch backset or 2-3/8 inch backset. This handleset will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2-1/2 inch door thicknesses. Choose from any of 6 lever or knobs for the interior trim.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin WES-TRR Traditional Westcliff Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p><p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Classic Arched Westcliff Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Length: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length (without deadbolt): 12-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length center to center (without deadbolt): 8-13/32\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Standard: 1-3/4\" - 2\" </li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Optional:  1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" or 2\" - 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
