                "title": "Westcliff Handleset with Round Interior Trim, Baldwin WES-TRR",
                "description": "The Westcliff Handleset features an arched exterior plate and round roses on the inside. It is available in 7 finishes--all of which have a 25 year warranty. Made by Baldwin, it is built to last; the Westcliff Entryset has a lifetime mechanical warranty. It is available as a single cylinder, a double cylinder, or a full dummy. The adjustable latch will accommodate 2-3/4 inch backset or 2-3/8 inch backset. This handleset will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2-1/2 inch door thicknesses. Choose from any of 6 lever or knobs for the interior trim.\r\n",
